categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aH-2gmo7cyl4FsW8HzwQYA","review_id":"Tdfhdx4oBS8adGvaDOVgYg","date":"2009-03-16T20:49:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9061564207077026,"text_excerpt":"CLOSED! :-( Lucky You has an excellent selection including candies that were big \"way back when\" and also candies from other countries. She even had the \"candy for a diet\" which is candy flavored spray! Tiffiny is wonderful to chat with and knows her stuff. It is a wonderful store to go into to get a treat!"},{"business_id":"aH-2gmo7cyl4FsW8HzwQYA","review_id":"WXdXGTUak-oaK7A0TbfUHw","date":"2008-08-17T23:57:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8992814421653748,"text_excerpt":"Oh WOW. Yummy! It smells so good and sugary inside and it's a feast for the eyes too. Lots of favorites and lots of fun things too like Hello Kitty chocolates, fancy chocolates, gummy pizzas, those waxy bottles of sugar water from when I was a kid, lots of jelly beans, weird but good little pastel communion wafer pockets filled with sugar and even dog treats. Tons of stuff is super cheap too so parents you have no excuse not to give your kids a treat, which is nice because it's so hard to go in to a candy store and say no, well here, you don't have to. The bathroom is all red roses and beautiful. The back party area is very inviting. Too bad we didn't know about this before we planned the..."},{"business_id":"aH-2gmo7cyl4FsW8HzwQYA","review_id":"x6tXeHTfE_iAf51mLmbNTQ","date":"2009-03-01T04:58:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8754199743270874,"text_excerpt":"Shh! Don't tell my dentist that I go in here OK. This is the store that you wished were next to your house when you were 10 years old. Seriously. It has a variety of candy to fit every need...or want...or whatever."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
